    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Presentation 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EMP301 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14440 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EMP301 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14440 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">90' in class</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">practical exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Suggested topics: 1.Present word formation rules and Compounding and clarify the contents with specific examples./2. Analyze Productivity versus Creativity. Give examples for each phenomenon/<br>3. Demonstrate Internal stem change and provide it with examples./4. Survey sorts of inflection (person, number, gender and noun class, tense and aspect, voice, mood, modality, and evidentiality) that can be found in the languages of the world./<br>5. Survey five languages to see what morphological resources they make use of./6. Investigate the relationship between morphology and syntax./7. Describe the intersection between morphology and phonology based on the chapter &quot;Sounds and Shapes: The Interface between Morphology and Phonology&quot;. Use specific examples to clarify your ideas./<br>8.Discuss the relation between morphology and syntax which can be kept separate from one another.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- The purpose of this activity is to assess students' understanding of the concepts and morphological process, the ability to research thoroughly, summarize, and synthesize the knowledge. In addition, students are equipped with presentation, communication, teamwork and active learning skills.<br>Instruction:<br>- The students in class are divided into groups of about 5 students. They choose randomly the topics related to the chapters in the textbook.<br>- Each group will have oral presentation to summarize, analyze and apply the content of an assigned chapter (in 25-30') and demonstrate it by specific instances.<br>- The lecturer will facilitate, consolidate, review, and give comments.<br>Expected Outcomes:<br>- explain examples and process of word formation<br>- comparing morphological phenomena across languages<br>- conducting linguistic research by investigating topics, finding relevant examples<br>- develop the ability to respond to questions from peers and instructors</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 53 — Presentation</li><li>Session 54 — Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 53 — Presentation</li><li>Buổi 54 — Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
